Built and verified a native Track B SALBP-2 generator based on the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1111.0934).

Key results:

- All G1–G9 gates pass.
- Shipping preset: `easy`, 40 tasks.
- Bare oracle: 0/3 solved — verdict `hardened`.
- Structural hint: 3/3 solved.
- Placebo hint: 0/3 solved.
- Random guessing: 0/200,000 from 137,846,528,820 balanced candidates.
- Reference MITM: 1,066,842 operations per instance on average.
- Compact residue route: 100 operations.
- Five adversarial attacks: 0/8 each.

